@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Publik / Jamaah" as Jamaah
boundary "Halaman Dashboard\n(/dashboard)" as DashboardPage
control "Trend API\n(/api/dashboard/trend)" as TrendAPI
entity "Database\n(PostgreSQL via Prisma raw SQL)" as DB

Jamaah -> DashboardPage : Buka menu Dashboard (/dashboard)
activate DashboardPage

DashboardPage -> TrendAPI : GET /api/dashboard/trend?range=6m
activate TrendAPI

TrendAPI -> DB : prisma.$queryRaw(`\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('week', "transactionDate") + INTERVAL '4 days' AS friday,\n  SUM(CASE WHEN type = 'pemasukan' THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS total_inflow,\n  SUM(CASE WHEN type = 'pengeluaran' THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS total_outflow\n  FROM "Transaction"\n  WHERE "isVerified" = true\n  GROUP BY friday ORDER BY friday ASC\n`)
activate DB
note right of DB: Mengelompokkan tren kas mingguan\nselaras tepat pada hari Jumat
DB --> TrendAPI : Raw aggregation rows
deactivate DB

TrendAPI -> TrendAPI : Hitung saldo kas berjalan (running balance) & metrik agregat
TrendAPI --> DashboardPage : 200 OK (trendData[], currentBalance, totalInflow, totalOutflow)
deactivate TrendAPI

DashboardPage -> DashboardPage : Render Hero Band Saldo & Grafik Recharts
DashboardPage -> Jamaah : Tampilkan visualisasi tren kas mingguan & bulanan
deactivate DashboardPage

@enduml
